<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8" standalone="yes"?><rss version="2.0" xmlns:atom="http://www.w3.org/2005/Atom"><channel><title>SafeAreaInset on 오깅중</title><link>https://jun7680.github.io/tags/safeareainset/</link><description>Recent content in SafeAreaInset on 오깅중</description><generator>Hugo</generator><language>ko</language><lastBuildDate>Thu, 14 May 2026 16:26:20 +0900</lastBuildDate><atom:link href="https://jun7680.github.io/tags/safeareainset/index.xml" rel="self" type="application/rss+xml"/><item><title>`.ignoresSafeArea(.bottom)` 한 줄에 액션 버튼이 통째로 사라졌다</title><link>https://jun7680.github.io/p/swiftui-ignoressafearea-bottom-overlay-trap/</link><pubDate>Thu, 14 May 2026 16:26:20 +0900</pubDate><guid>https://jun7680.github.io/p/swiftui-ignoressafearea-bottom-overlay-trap/</guid><description>&lt;h2 id="도입"&gt;도입&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;새 SwiftUI 화면을 만들고 있었다. 배경색이 화면 최하단(home indicator 영역)까지 깔리게 하고 싶어서 본체 View에 한 줄을 추가했다.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div class="highlight"&gt;&lt;pre tabindex="0" class="chroma"&gt;&lt;code class="language-swift" data-lang="swift"&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="n"&gt;ignoresSafeArea&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;(&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="n"&gt;edges&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;:&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="p"&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="n"&gt;bottom&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;)&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;ScrollView 위에 액션 버튼을 &lt;code&gt;.overlay(alignment: .bottom)&lt;/code&gt;으로 띄워둔 화면이었다. 시뮬레이터를 띄워보니 액션 버튼이 home indicator 위까지 그려져 있었다. 탭은 되는데 디자인이 어긋났다.&lt;/p&gt;</description></item></channel></rss>